IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `icasp-spouse-residence`

-- ICA's published framework for a citizen's foreign spouse -- worked cases. Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING
-- of ICA's pages as read on 12 October 2026, not about the law. Scenario dates after October 2026 (h049 is 20 July 2033)
-- are answered on the policy as published in October 2026: ICA may have changed it by then.

§ `REQ-0291 (cradle-to-grave-haziq h049, 20 July 2033)`

-- A citizen's foreign wife, PR for two years, married for nine, her citizen husband sponsoring: within the published
-- category, so she may apply; the grant is discretionary. Answered on the October 2026 pages.
#ASSERT `eligible to apply for citizenship as a citizen's spouse` 2 9 TRUE
#ASSERT `the published citizenship answer for a citizen's spouse` 2 9 TRUE EQUALS `may apply; grant at the Government's discretion`
#ASSERT NOT `ICA's pages make citizenship a right for an eligible spouse`
-- What must she renounce? ICA's adult pages do not say; the question stays open (see NOTES.md finding 2).
#ASSERT NOT `ICA's adult citizenship pages state that foreign citizenship must be renounced`
#ASSERT NOT `ICA's adult citizenship pages state that an oath must be taken`
-- Nadia is 35 at h049: she must complete the Singapore Citizenship Journey; fees $100 + $70 + $10 = $180.
#ASSERT `must complete the Singapore Citizenship Journey` 35
#ASSERT `citizenship fees in all` 35 EQUALS 180

§ `REQ-0286 (cradle-to-grave-haziq h033, 10 December 2024) -- the published part only`

-- A citizen's Malaysian wife: an eligible LTVP category when her husband sponsors; PR open to a citizen's spouse with no
-- stated minimum period. The ledger entry stays open under the Immigration Regulations.
#ASSERT `eligible to apply for an LTVP as a citizen's spouse` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `eligible to apply for PR as the spouse of a citizen or PR` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `ICA's PR page states a minimum period of marriage or residence for a spouse`

§ `Citizenship eligibility for a spouse -- the boundaries`

#ASSERT `eligible to apply for citizenship as a citizen's spouse` 2 2 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `eligible to apply for citizenship as a citizen's spouse` 1.9 9 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `eligible to apply for citizenship as a citizen's spouse` 6 1.5 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `eligible to apply for citizenship as a citizen's spouse` 6 9 FALSE
#ASSERT `the published citizenship answer for a citizen's spouse` 1 9 TRUE EQUALS `not within the published category`

-- A spouse married for only one year may still come in as an adult PR of 2 years, aged 21 or more.
#ASSERT `eligible to apply for citizenship on either footing` 3 1 TRUE 30
#ASSERT NOT `eligible to apply for citizenship on either footing` 1 5 TRUE 30
#ASSERT `eligible to apply for citizenship as an adult PR` 2 21
#ASSERT NOT `eligible to apply for citizenship as an adult PR` 2 20

§ `Singapore Citizenship Journey and fees`

#ASSERT `must complete the Singapore Citizenship Journey` 16
#ASSERT `must complete the Singapore Citizenship Journey` 60
#ASSERT NOT `must complete the Singapore Citizenship Journey` 61
#ASSERT NOT `must complete the Singapore Citizenship Journey` 15
#ASSERT `citizenship fee at completion` 14 EQUALS 70
#ASSERT `citizenship fee at completion` 15 EQUALS 80

§ `The minor's ORAL (page 3)`

#ASSERT `within the window for a minor's ORAL` 21
#ASSERT NOT `within the window for a minor's ORAL` 22
#ASSERT `a citizen registered as a minor loses citizenship for want of the ORAL` 22 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a citizen registered as a minor loses citizenship for want of the ORAL` 22 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a citizen registered as a minor loses citizenship for want of the ORAL` 21.5 FALSE
#ASSERT `fee for the ORAL` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the ORAL documents include a foreign citizenship renunciation certificate`

§ `Permanent residence (page 4)`

-- $100 + $20 + $50 + $50 = $220.
#ASSERT `PR fees in all` EQUALS 220
#ASSERT NOT `eligible to apply for PR as the spouse of a citizen or PR` TRUE FALSE

§ `Long-Term Visit Pass (pages 5 to 7)`

-- $45 + $60 = $105; with a multiple journey visa, $45 + $60 + $30 = $135.
#ASSERT `LTVP fees in all` FALSE EQUALS 105
#ASSERT `LTVP fees in all` TRUE EQUALS 135
#ASSERT NOT `marriage to a citizen guarantees an LTVP`
#ASSERT NOT `eligible to apply for an LTVP as a citizen's spouse` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `processing time for a citizen's spouse's LTVP` TRUE EQUALS `within 6 weeks`
#ASSERT `processing time for a citizen's spouse's LTVP` FALSE EQUALS `up to 6 months`
#ASSERT `the PMLA letter can still be used` 11
#ASSERT NOT `the PMLA letter can still be used` 13
#ASSERT `the LTVP renewal is submitted as ICA asks` 3
#ASSERT NOT `the LTVP renewal is submitted as ICA asks` 2
#ASSERT NOT `remaining LTVP validity is carried into the renewed pass`
